  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 8008.03 Requirements for Renewal of Business Entity License",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 8008.03 Requirements for Renewal of Business Entity License.\n\n(a) Prior to the expiration of a business entity license, the business entity shall renew the license by submitting the following to the state fire marshal’s office:\n\n(1) The documentation set forth in Saf-C 8005.01(c); and\n\n(2) Applicable fee.\n\nSource. #8954, eff 7-21-07; ss by #9542, eff 9-10-09",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c8000.html"
}
